[10:20] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'coding sounds like an oxymoron because spec driven implies that there\'s engineering rigor and discipline. And vibe coding implies a complete lack of discipline. We\'re just prompting. We\'re just doing one shot prompts and getting the LLM to spit out code. This is the'

[10:33] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'best of both worlds. We get the best of vibe coding where the LLM does all the heavy lifting, but we still have the rigorous uh controls and discipline of software engineering best practices by coming up with detailed specs and getting the LLM to work off of those'

